@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/business

### Scenario 1: order + successful payment + failed callback
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/O202607060001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 2: cancelled order refund
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/O202607060002/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 3: coupon eligibility
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons/FULL300LESS50?customerNo=C202607003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 4: member benefits
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/M202607060004
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 5: logistics comparison
GET {{baseUrl}}/logistics/SF202607060005
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 6: API failures
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-calls/CLIENT-DEMO-01?apiName=queryOrder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario 7: invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/O202607060007/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
